<title>USA: North Face names Simon as CEO.</title>
<headline>North Face names Simon as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN LEANDRO, Calif 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Face Inc said William Simon was named chief executive officer in addition to his current role as president.</p>
<p>The company said Marsden Cason, formerly chief executive officer, was named chairman of the board.</p>
<p>The company indicated the change was due in part to health considerations affecting Cason.</p>
